            "review_title": "Review at Thanh Tuyen 3",
            "review_text": "restyyy\nJakarta, Indonesia131 contributions\n0\nCheap and good food! Nice restaurant!\nJul 2014\nSo like other reviewer here I am disappointed by most restaurants in Nha trang as they mostly overpriced and the waiters suck. This one is different. I am staying in Nguyen Thiat (sp?) so a bit walking from the beach and decided to have lunch at these restaurants along the beach. Found this nice little gem with only Vietnamese patrons in it and when I checked the menu it's cheap! Ordered pork pho, a coffee, and orange juice and pho was goooooood! I'm still sitting here when I'm writing this, after done with my lunch! So if you're looking for good foods, and cheap one, this is the one restaurant to go!\nRead more\nWritten July 30, 2014",
