            "review_text": "L T\nPlacentia, California117 contributions\n0\nGood solid vietnamese food at decent prices\nJan 2014 • Couples\nThere are muliple locations of this restaurant all over Nha Trang. We had lunch here since it's close to our hotel. Pretty good food at decent prices. Nothing too memorable though. If you want best seafood, take a taxi to Quán Óc Xuân Anh (get the address and phone number from Facebook to avoid taxi driver taking you to \"wrong\" restaurant) where you can buy whatever seems fresh and you like, then have it grilled, sauteed, etc... To your liking. Very reasonable prices.\nRead more\nWritten January 20, 2014",
